+# Context Composer (Aegis) — operator guide
+
+Components
+- semantic_chunker: splits documents into overlapping chunks with sentence-based heuristics.
+- summarizer: calls a configured LLM summarizer or uses extractive fallback.
+- context_composer_v2: orchestrates chunking, retrieval, summarization and token-budget aware composition.
+- redis_store: scalable session store for conversation state and token accounting.
+
+How to use
+- Implement or wire a retriever with `query_texts(query, chunks, topk)` to be used by composer.
+- Set SUMMARIZER_ENDPOINT env var to point to a summarizer service for better summaries.
+- Use Redis by setting REDIS_URL and replace file-backed session manager.
